+    512-dim layer is heads 2h and 2h+1 of the 256-dim view, contiguous and
+    in order, so the attention backend's
+    ``get_key_buffer(l).view(-1, page, real_heads, real_dim)`` recovers the
+    checkpoint geometry byte-for-byte.
